  "method": "Group b by the two-adic square condition and the odd prime support. Since M_b <= M_global, it is enough to check M_global. For odd support size s, the verifier enumerates the first s-1 odd primes in the support; the omitted final odd prime and all exponent choices can only reduce the admissible m count.",
